{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type VoiceOrigin = \"premade\" | \"generated\" | \"cloned\" | \"professional\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2772","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2772"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Where a voice in a provider's catalog came from."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'premade'"},{"type":"text","value":" is the provider's own stock catalog. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'generated'"},{"type":"text","value":" and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'cloned'"},{"type":"text","value":" are voices the account made, which is what "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateVoice()"},{"type":"text","value":"\nproduces. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'professional'"},{"type":"text","value":" covers a provider's curated or paid tiers."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype VoiceOrigin = \"premade\" | \"generated\" | \"cloned\" | \"professional\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2772](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2772)\n\nWhere a voice in a provider's catalog came from.\n\n`'premade'` is the provider's own stock catalog. `'generated'` and\n`'cloned'` are voices the account made, which is what `generateVoice()`\nproduces. `'professional'` covers a provider's curated or paid tiers.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: VoiceOrigin\ntitle: VoiceOrigin\n---\n\n```ts\ntype VoiceOrigin = \"premade\" | \"generated\" | \"cloned\" | \"professional\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2772](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2772)\n\nWhere a voice in a provider's catalog came from.\n\n`'premade'` is the provider's own stock catalog. `'generated'` and\n`'cloned'` are voices the account made, which is what `generateVoice()`\nproduces. `'professional'` covers a provider's curated or paid tiers.\n"}
